SET PRC_DESC

/
'FI'.'CCU-HUB' 'Collecting captured carbon from both fossil and biogenics based not to P2G'
'FI'.'EXPCO2-fromFI-biogenics' 'Bio-originated + DACCS captured carbon transportation from Finland to possible storage sites'
'FI'.'EXPCO2-fromFI-coastal' 'From source points in coastal areas to be put in storage'
'FI'.'EXPCO2-fromFI-DACCS' 'Captured carbon transportation from DACCS leaving Finland to possible storage sites'
'FI'.'EXPCO2-fromFI-fossil' 'Fossil-based captured carbon transportation from Finland to possible storage sites'
'FI'.'EXPCO2-fromFI-inland' 'From source points in inland areas to be put in storage'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_ATM' 'Supply convert Atmospheric CO2 to Diesel'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_ATM_LowAF' 'Supply convert Atmospheric CO2 to Diesel'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_ATM_MeOH' 'Supply convert Atmospheric CO2 to Methanol'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_ATM_MeOH_LowAF' 'Supply convert Atmospheric CO2 to Methanol LowAF'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_EMIS' 'Supply convert CCS emission to Diesel using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_EMIS_H2T' 'CO2 Hydrogenation to Diesel with centralized tank using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_EMIS_H2T_LowAF' 'CO2 Hydrogenation to Diesel with centralized tank using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_EMIS_H2U' 'CO2 Hydrogenation to Diesel with underground storage using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_EMIS_H2U_LowAF' 'CO2 Hydrogenation to Diesel with underground storage using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_EMIS_LowAF' 'Supply convert CCS emission to Diesel using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_EMISMeOH' 'Supply convert CCS emission to Methanol using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_EMISMeOH_H2' 'Supply convert CCS emission to Methanol supplied by H2 using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_EMISMeOH_H2_LowAF' 'Supply convert CCS emission to Methanol supplied by H2 LowAF using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_EMISMeOH_LowAF' 'Supply convert CCS emission to Methanol LowAF using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_P2GT' 'Methanation - Centralized Tank storage using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_P2GT_B' 'Methanation - Centralized Tank storage using biogenics-originated carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_P2GT_B_LowAF' 'Methanation - Centralized Tank storage using biogenics-originated carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_P2GT_LowAF' 'Methanation - Centralized Tank storage using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_P2GU' 'Methanation - Centralized Underground storage using captured carbon'
'FI'.'S_CCUS_P2GU_B' 'Methanation - Centralized Underground storage using biogenics-originated carbon'
