'FI'.'S_CCUS_P2GU_LowAF' 'Methanation - Centralized Underground storage using captured carbon'
'FI'.'SINKCCU-biogenics' 'Removal by CCU using biogenics-based captured carbon'
'FI'.'SINKCCU-fossil' 'Removal by CCU using fossil-based captured carbon'
'FI'.'SNK_DAC' 'Direct Air Capture - Chemical Absorption'
'FI'.'SNK_DAC_GAS' 'Direct Air Capture - Chemical Absorption - Gas'
'FI'.'SNK_DAC_GAS_LowAF' 'Direct Air Capture - Chemical Absorption'
'FI'.'SNK_DAC_LowAF' 'Direct Air Capture - Chemical Absorption'
